{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id106823492"}, "name":{"label":"Muttieu"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-04-19T13:14:43-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.5"}, "id":{"label":"13975963879"}, "title":{"label":"Constantly asking me to pay"}, "content":{"label":"I don’t understand why people love this app so much. Every time I open it I’m harassed to pay $20 to access weather annually. What a joke. Those are you who pay I hope you’re getting your $20 worth.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=961390574&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id160810705"}, "name":{"label":"Jazzhands4Ever"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-04-19T08:19:51-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.5"}, "id":{"label":"13975077817"}, "title":{"label":"Getting better"}, "content":{"label":"Things seem to be improving and ultimate is worth five stars. Now the only major improvement I would suggest is to have a quicker way to change from Fahrenheit to Celsius. 5 touches is a little too much. It would be nice to be able to flip this very quickly at the main settings menu having C/F available right there instead of drilling down multiple levels to get to it in general settings. If you could make this a toggle feature, that would be way better otherwise great.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=961390574&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"4"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"12"}}, 
