{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id430591214"}, "name":{"label":"DelightedGhost"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-04-08T19:02:50-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.5"}, "id":{"label":"13937735691"}, "title":{"label":"A fallen legacy"}, "content":{"label":"This app used to be amazing, without a subscription you could still access most of what I think should be base information. You even had a few sources to choose from still. Now, after years of watching them add subscription tiers and even raise the price multitudes of times I just can’t support it. I got this app when it was new in high school, and I loved it. It made funny jokes and was always more accurate than Apple. Now it’s never accurate and might I reiterate, doesn’t give me even the most basic information without paying for it. It kills me to delete an app I have this long of a history with but after the most recent severe weather in my state this app was completely useless to me. I have a family now and I require accurate information to keep them and myself safe.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=961390574&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"2"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"2"}}, 
