{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id972722681"}, "name":{"label":"thearcbuildr"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-04-04T08:37:30-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.5"}, "id":{"label":"13921997998"}, "title":{"label":"One of the best weather apps!"}, "content":{"label":"I love Carrot! It’s hilarious, very customizable, and just great overall. However, I do  have some wishes that I wish would be fulfilled in future updates. First, I wish the app didn’t require a subscription for Apple Watch, as I feel like a majority of third party weather apps have a free Watch version of their app. I also wish that widgets were the same way (even if they were basic, not very customizable, and only update every hour and when the app is opened). Second, I wish some notifications were available, like weather alerts. While these understandably require API calls which are expensive, the weather.gov API is free, and I feel like that could be implemented, especially since requiring alerts that need to wake up people from severe weather is necessary to save lives. I believe that the air raid siren is an awesome way to wake people up, and it should be free for everyone. Third, I wish that the radar feature was free. I definitely understand if this would be barebones with only an hour into the future or not implemented at all, but I still think that it should be included in some capacity. Last, I think the ability to allow users to use their own API key for weather and other features should be added, as well as the weather.gov API for another source option, as it is free, and offers alerts and forecast data, even if it is somewhat limited. Overall, I really enjoy this app and I am very happy to see the future features of it! I would definitely recommend using Carrot to both the reader of this review and my friends and family.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=961390574&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
